  <metadata>
    <title>Admin surfaces (route sweep, 9 routes): put the record-matching admin routes behind the existing "SystemAdmin" policy, and make the SPE admin tenant-scope boundary actually run on /api/spe/configs CRUD and /api/spe/bulk/delete + /bulk/permissions (route param named "id", configId carried in the body, unscoped business unit and unscoped app identity on create/update, fail-open scope lookup)</title>
    <phase>Session 27 — route authorization sweep (owner round 9, 2026-10-03)</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
