    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Authorization-path .cs change on live BFF routes (tags bff-api, auth, security). Closes an operator job any signed-in user can trigger, and a cross-business-unit read, rewrite and delete of SPE container-type configs, a cross-business-unit config create that borrows another unit's container type or app identity, and a cross-business-unit bulk container delete and owner grant.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Security/auth-sensitive. Two different mechanisms (an admin policy on one group; the tenant-scope filter on the other), five separate ways the existing tenant-scope boundary is bypassed, and a fail-open fix whose blast radius is all 68 /api/spe routes. Each fix must keep "unknown and denied answer the same" without breaking the shipped SPE Admin app.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
