CODE-COMPLETE FOR THE NINE SWEEP ROUTES + THREE OF FOUR AMENDMENT ITEMS; TWO ESCALATIONS STOPPED; LIVE GATES PENDING. Full record: notes/task-165-admin-surfaces.md (§0 summary, §1 167 state, §2 read-only live facts, §3 change map + placement + justification, §4 escalations, §5 tests + seeding proofs, §6 ledger input, §7 decisions, §8 not in this task, §9 manual live gate).

