    <outcome date="2026-10-04" branch="task/uac-r2-165-r2">
FIX ROUNDS r1 + r2 (owner rounds 16 and 20; adversarial verifier re-verification 2026-10-04). Full record: notes/task-165-admin-surfaces.md §10.

BRANCH: task/uac-r2-165-r2 from task/uac-r2-165-r1 (fast-forward to 5c8192f11 = the main session's commit 1712af73b of r1's uncommitted work, minus its coordination note), plus the r2 commit.

ROUND 16 ITEM 4 (environments, option (a)) — DONE: only a platform operator (own business unit = the root) writes sprk_speenvironment (POST/PUT/DELETE: one 403 spe.admin.deny.environment_write_requires_platform_operator before any read); any other admin reads only environments linked by a config they reach (by-id: one 404 spe.admin.deny.environment_out_of_scope, byte-identical to the handler not-found; list trimmed in-handler); reach unreadable or a full 5000-row page: 503; config POST/PUT may link only a readable environment (403 spe.admin.deny.environment_out_of_scope; order BU, environment, identity). No new column.
