SUITES (r2): full BFF unit 14,380 passed / 0 failed / 54 skipped; NetArchTest 347 / 0 / 0; Sprk.Bff.Api.IntegrationTests 104 / 0 / 0; Spe.Integration.Tests 403 / 0 / 25 skipped. Affected classes 166 / 0.

