NOT CLOSED: (a) publish size — skipped per this round's instruction; pre-merge main-session measurement (note §10.7); no package change, no CVE delta. (b) OWNER ROUND 20 ITEMS 1-3 (per-container business-unit binding: container custom property stamped at creation + backfill script; per-container authorization on container/item/permission/bulk routes; narrowed duplicate check) — OWED BY TASK 165, dedicated follow-up round run by the main session (note §10.8). (c) Two low items for the main session to file as GitHub issues, exact commands in note §10.9 (dashboard per-config storage; bulk status not bound to caller). (d) Manual live gates (note §9, incl. (g) environments).
